<title>USA: Rubin repeats U.S. supports strong dollar.</title>
<headline>Rubin repeats U.S. supports strong dollar.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Treasury Secretary Robert Rubin said Saturday the U.S. supports a strong dollar.</p>
<p>&quot;We are in favor of a strong dollar,&quot; he told reporters as Group of Seven finance ministers and central bank governors began talks.</p>
</text>
